# Primeval Park's raptor burrow (CIPlay primeval_park_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the
# recipe: the new knoll hw_mount at 55 50 (b 16, h 16); kit_dig mouth at 38 50 (yaw 90: way in = +x), 3 m level, 10 m on,
# a room at the end (~51..57); the sign ppburrowsign at 30 45; two hyenas inside; zone pp_burrow at 47 50. Floor 3.52 (a guess).
# 11-17 w14E: floor 3.3 (dig log), offset from the build; the hyenas wait for zone pp_hyenas (41.5 50).
# 11-17 w14E: in-cave pictures at absolute heights - a '+h' height is taken over the hill's top, so the camera (and the player) stood on the hill.
island Primeval Park keep
offset -9.0526 -0.9373
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the burrow's mouth from the paddock
picture pp_burrow_out 30 +3 50 38 +1.5 50
read RAPTOR BURROW

# The "raptors" (11-12 mixed monsters): two hyenas, waiting in the room until a player is in the passage (zone
# pp_hyenas at 41.5 50 - 11-17 w14E: one roamed out of the mouth before the player came)
# (w14I: woken, they rush the player and one stood out of the mouth at the check - so they are counted in the room first)
# 11-17 w14R: the recipe spawns them when zone pp_hyenas is entered (none before: 0 at the island's coming), so they
# are counted under the roof right after the walk into the zone (2 s later one had already run out: 1 of 2)
walk 31 47 to 34 50 to 38 50 to 41.5 50
expect animalsinside Hyena 2
wait 2
expect animals Hyena 2
kill Hyena
expect animals Hyena 0

# In to the chamber
walk 41.5 50 to 47 50
zone pp_burrow
# (w14I: at 5.8 the camera stood in the knoll - a white wash; now 1.5 m over the passage floor)
picture pp_burrow_in 44 4.0 50 54 3.8 50 light=20
walk 47 50 to 41 50 to 38 50 to 34 50
